GIMP Palette
Name: Tokyo Night
#
# Tokyo Night (Night variant, default) for Xournal++
# Source: enkia/tokyo-night-vscode-theme (now tokyo-night/tokyo-night-vscode-theme)
# README "Color Palette" table + themes/tokyo-night-color-theme.json
#   editor.background #1a1b26 (Night; Storm uses #24283b instead)
#   editor.foreground #a9b1d6, variables #c0caf5
# Background first / Foreground last mirrors the Dracula Xournal++ port.
# Install: file lives in ~/.config/xournalpp/palettes/, then
#   Edit -> Preferences -> Palette -> Tokyo Night (restart if missing).
# Tip: set page background to #1a1b26 via Journal -> Configure Page Template.
